          "description": "On-demand real /v1/chat/completions call with a caller-supplied prompt, for manual sanity-checking (same mechanism as check_health(deep=True) but user-controlled). Rate-limited -- consumes real GPU inference cycles on shared infra. max_tokens is clamped server-side to config.MAX_TEST_COMPLETION_TOKENS and the prompt is capped at config.MAX_TEST_COMPLETION_PROMPT_CHARS (oversized prompts are rejected) -- the rate limiter bounds call frequency, not the cost of a single call. Returns {ok, model_id, completion_s, text, error}.",
